{"ref":"BDB, גַּנָּב","hw":"גַּנָּב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גַּנָּב</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:1\" href=\"/Exodus.22.1\">Ex 22:1</a> <strong>thief</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">גַּנָּב</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:1\" href=\"/Exodus.22.1\">Ex 22:1</a> + 12 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּנָּבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.23\">Is 1:23</a> + 3 times—<em>thief</em> that breaks in <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:1\" href=\"/Exodus.22.1\">Ex 22:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:6\" href=\"/Exodus.22.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:7\" href=\"/Exodus.22.7\">7</a> (JE); by window <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:9\" href=\"/Joel.2.9\">Jo 2:9</a> (in simile); <em>thief</em> as one who steals <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.23\">Is 1:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 50:18\" href=\"/Psalms.50.18\">ψ 50:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.30\">Pr 6:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.24\">29:24</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.26\">Je 2:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:27\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.27\">48:27</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:1\" href=\"/Hosea.7.1\">Ho 7:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדוּד</span>) <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 5:4\" href=\"/Zechariah.5.4\">Zc 5:4</a>; coming by night <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.9\">Je 49:9</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Job 24:14\" href=\"/Job.24.14\">Jb 24:14</a> (in simile), <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:5\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.5\">Ob 5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוֹדֲדֵי לַיְלָה</span>); <a data-ref=\"Job 30:5\" href=\"/Job.30.5\">Jb 30:5</a>; stealer of men (slave-dealer) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.7\">Dt 24:7</a>.","next":"BDB, גְּנֻבַת","prev":"BDB, גְּנֵבָה"}